  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Green Deal TEI Facility II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Green Deal TEI Facility II - The Support Measure - Cooperation Facility is a flexible instrument to contribute to the achievement of the objectives and results identified in the overall framework of the EU cooperation in Mozambique. It seeks to &#xbf;enhance the effectiveness, efficiency and impact of the EU-Mozambique partnership&#xbf; (the overall objective) and therefore increase the EU role to support national policy reforms. The instrument will act transversally through three main components to ensure an effective and impactful implementation of the MIP 2021-2027, TEIs and other actions implemented under the overall framework of EU cooperation in Mozambique (specific objective 1); to promote policy dialogues, including gender equality and women empowerment (GEWE), and joint coordination  with Government and other relevant key stakeholders (specific objective 2); and to enhance an inclusive EU&#xbf;s strategic communication and public diplomacy (specific objective 3).The Overall Objective of this action is to enhance the effectiveness, efficiency and impact of the EU-Mozambique partnership. The Specific Objectives of this action are to: 1.Ensure an effective and impactful implementation of the MIP 2021-2027, TEIs and other actions implemented under the overall framework of EU cooperation in Mozambique;2.Promote policy dialogues and joint coordination with Government and other relevant key stakeholders for the EU cooperation in Mozambique;3.Increase perception, awareness and understanding of the EU through inclusive EU&#xbf;s strategic communication and public diplomacy activities.The Outputs to be delivered by this action contributing to the corresponding Specific Objectives are:&amp;nbsp;Contributing to Outcome 1 (or Specific Objective 1): 1.1&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Enhanced identification, formulation, implementation, monitoring, audit and evaluation of EU programmes under the MIP 2021-2027, TEIs and other EU funded programmes and actions in Mozambique;1.2&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Improved skills and capacities of the key stakeholders (as specified in 2.2) for programming and implementation of national and regional EU resources.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Contributing to Outcome 2 (or Specific Objective 2): 2.1&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Enhanced engagement in EU interventions in Mozambique with a more coherent, inclusive and integrated approach.Contributing to Outcome 3 (or Specific Objective 3): Increased perception and awareness of the EU and the shared values underpinning EU-Mozambique partnership, including through the Global Gateway in a Team Europe approach.</narrative>
  </description>
